{"id":"n73443-2-16","stage":0,"title":"끄다 · 关","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73443-2-16-1","ko":"음악이 시끄럽구나.","zh":"音乐声音好大啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음악이","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악이","audio":"/audio/73fb5ea6da0471d25f2b.mp3"}},{"text":"시끄럽구나.","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시끄럽구나","audio":"/audio/f12722d18b252272b375.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a637bf114a54bd7f8b9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73443-2-16-2","ko":"그래요? 그럼 음악을 잠시 꺼 놓을까요?","zh":"是吗？那我把音乐暂时关掉吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"음악을","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악을","audio":"/audio/e98d4fc72578a9d7791a.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时。","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"꺼","meaning":"关","explanation":"끄다：关；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"끄다","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73443","senseId":"2","lemma":"끄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꺼","audio":"/audio/ae612f4a3170eae8c237.mp3"}},{"text":"놓을까요?","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓을까요","audio":"/audio/62b21ced431faf6c824a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"1e0c0d787abf4da9","term":"끄다","zh":"关","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3","entryId":"73443","definition":"切断电流或机器运转动力的路径，使其停止运行。","pronunciation":["끄다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/fbf7cc0441b490bde99b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73443","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":19,"sequenceScore":0.7801,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那我把音乐暂时关掉吧？","音乐声音好大啊。","那是承奎先生家吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["音乐声音好大啊。","那是承奎先生家吗？","是吗？那我把音乐暂时关掉吧？"],"answer":2}]}
